---
import LegalLayout from '../../../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
import { translations } from '../../../i18n/translations';

const lang = 'en' as const;
const t = translations[lang];
---
<LegalLayout
  lang={lang}
  currentRoute="privacy"
  title={`${t.footer.privacy} — Kaxa`}
  description={t.meta.description}
  heading="Privacy Policy"
  updated="Last updated: June 10, 2026"
>
  <h2>1. Introduction</h2>
  <p>
    At Kaxa ("Kaxa", "we") we respect your privacy and are committed to protecting your personal
    and financial information. This Privacy Policy explains what information we collect, how we
    use it, and what rights you have over it.
  </p>

  <h2>2. Information we collect</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      Financial information you enter manually: expenses, income, pockets, budgets, debts, and
      savings goals. This information is stored only on your device.
    </li>
    <li>
      Information related to your subscription (plan status, purchase identifiers), managed by
      Google Play and/or the App Store through RevenueCat.
    </li>
    <li>
      Basic technical device information (model, operating system) used by these platforms to
      process your subscription.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>3. How we use your information</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      To operate and maintain Kaxa's core features (transaction tracking, pockets, budgets, debts,
      and goals) directly on your device.
    </li>
    <li>To generate your financial reports and summaries.</li>
    <li>To manage your subscription and free trial.</li>
    <li>To communicate with you about important changes to the service, if you contact us.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>4. Storage and security</h2>
  <p>
    Your financial information (expenses, income, pockets, budgets, debts, and goals) is stored
    locally on your device and is not sent to our servers. Information related to your
    subscription is processed securely through RevenueCat, Google Play, and/or the App Store.
  </p>

  <h2>5. Subscriptions and payments</h2>
  <p>
    Kaxa subscriptions are processed through Google Play and/or the App Store via RevenueCat.
    Kaxa does not store or have access to your full payment card details; these are managed
    directly by the corresponding app store.
  </p>

  <h2>6. Sharing information with third parties</h2>
  <p>
    We do not sell your financial information or share it with third parties for advertising
    purposes. Information related to your subscription is shared only with RevenueCat and the
    corresponding app stores to process your payment.
  </p>

  <h2>7. Your rights</h2>
  <p>
    You can access, correct, or delete your financial information at any time from the app. If
    you uninstall Kaxa or delete its data, this information is permanently removed from your
    device.
  </p>

  <h2>8. Children's privacy</h2>
  <p>Kaxa is not directed at children under 13, and we do not knowingly collect information from children.</p>

  <h2>9. Changes to this policy</h2>
  <p>
    We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. We will post any changes on this page
    with a new "last updated" date.
  </p>

  <h2>10. Contact</h2>
  <p>
    If you have questions about this Privacy Policy, write to us at
    <a href={`mailto:${t.footer.contactEmail}`} class="text-primary underline">{t.footer.contactEmail}</a>.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
